veritas (0.11.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Test results record their file and duration: the JUnit document carries
    file, suite path and time per test, and adds a GitHub Actions reporter that
    writes check annotations and a step summary.

 -- Josep Bigorra <jjbigorra@gmail.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100

veritas (0.10.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * A single-process run keeps going after a failing file: the files after it
    still run, every failure is named together, and the global totals are
    printed before the run exits 1.

 -- Josep Bigorra <jjbigorra@gmail.com>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0100

veritas (0.10.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Every run ends with its totals: the files, suites, tests and assertions of
    the whole run, merged across the workers of --jobs.

 -- Josep Bigorra <jjbigorra@gmail.com>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100

veritas (0.9.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Coverage that works: the VM engine is switched for the measured part of a
    run, so the reports carry real counts.
  * LCOV, JSON, Cobertura, JaCoCo and a one-page HTML report, merged over a
    whole run and over the workers of --jobs.
  * Coverage filters, destinations and formats through keywords, environment
    variables and command line flags.

 -- Josep Bigorra <jjbigorra@gmail.com>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0100

